  "usageGuide": "guides/components/calendar.md",
  "usage": {
    "summary": "`good-calendar` presents appointments in **month, week, day, and list** views. It owns period navigation, today navigation, view switching, the 24-hour time grid, overlapping appointment lanes, all-day rows, scrolling, responsive layout, and event presentation. The week starts on Monday by default. The four views use the same event data and local browser time zone.",
